      "body": "1,200 nitrate frames were scanned in the CRO imaging suite in July 2024. Humidity rose to 62% by the afternoon, condensation appeared on 14 frames, and the conservator stopped the run. CRO is not suitable for nitrate in summer. Do not repeat the pilot unchanged.",
